:: Bouncer 1 ID {"position":"300,500","size":"100,100"}
/background is club exterior
/Bouncer is center screen.

(Approaching the club fills you with a heavy sense of dread and unfamiliarity. You have never done anything like this before and have grown accustomed to your life of solitude and peace.)
(A light tingling feeling of excitement can be felt in your legs with every step that brings you closer to the entrance.)
(The queue infront of you trickles down, slowly reducing in number as The Bouncer lets the guests through.)
(After about ten minutes, it's your turn.)

/bouncer enters screen middle.

"ID?"

(You rifle through your pockets and grab onto your ID, handing it to the bouncer.)
(He examines it closely for a few seconds.)

"Hmmm..."
"You don't look the same right now as you do here, could you frown for me?"



No.
[[Smile Bouncer 1 ID]] 

Alright.
[[Frown Bouncer 1 ID]]


:: Exposition {"position":"100,500","size":"100,100"}
//No characters on screen, just blank text against a black background//

It's Friday night, you think about spending another evening at home, acting out scenarios with different masks on. Your collection has been growing day by day since you started shutting yourself indoors and living as a recluse, spending your time painting and modelling masks of many shapes and sizes. You place your hand on your favourite mask, the one you have worked on day and night for countless hours, your magnum opus. 

A flyer slides under your front door. "Mask-n-Date Party". You wanna go! To show off your lovely mask!


[[Bouncer 1 ID]]


