:: Party Entrance {"position":"800,700","size":"100,100"}
(As you walk past the bouncer to enter, he grabs you by the hand.)
(What the hell???)
(He turns to you and looks deep into your eyes.)
"Remember... PLAYERNAME-"
(How does he know my name???)
"It says it on your ID silly!"
(CAN HE HEAR MY THOUGHTS?)
"REMEMBER... PLAYERNAME. When expressing your emotions, green is your true self, while red is your false self, okay?"
(

(You take out your mask and put it on, preparing yourself for what is to come.)

/player icon becomes player mask
/background is ballroom

(Stepping into the ballroom, bright light hits your eyes, a stark contrast to the dark night on the street that you were standing on just a few seconds ago.)
(Looking around, you see dozens of guests, each dressed in formal attire and donning masks resembling various monsters.)
(A man in a zombie mask taps you on the shoulder followed by a thumbs-up as he appreciates the artistry that you put into your mask.)
(Across the room, you spy guests dressed as both a vampire and a werewolf standing together and ushering you over towards them.)
(Your heart skips a beat at the sight of the two of them, you quickly follow their gesture and approach.)

/Vampire enters left side, Werewolf enters right side
/Until they introduce themselves by name, the text box will just refer to them as vampire and werewolf

V: "Well, well, well, I wasn't expecting to see anyone else like us at this party!"

/werewolf shocked sprite
(The werewolf's eyes widen in shock as the vampire says this and quickly interjects)

/werewolf neutral sprite
W: "AHEM, he means that you have an extremely realistic mask! Did you make it yourself?"

(You nod.)

V: "Such a pity, you spent all this time on your mask while the only thing I care about is what you have underneath it."
"Take it off, please."

(You oblige, removing your mask infront of them both.)
(Their jaws drop in shock as they catch sight of your real face.)

/werewolf shocked sprite
/vampire shocked sprite
Both: "Woah."

/werewolf neutral sprite
/vampire neutral sprite
W: "Sorry, you just have... such a unique face."
"It's so... round... and smooth."

(You blush, slightly unsure of whether this is a compliment or insult.)

V: "Anyways, unmasked friend of mine, how are you enjoying the party so far?"

(Honestly, you have never enjoyed social occasions, the expectations put upon you by others to perform to their standards has always grated away at your mental health as you slowly feel yourself lose autonomy during conversations.) 

I'm having a great time! (fake)
[[Smile Party Entrance]] 

I don't like parties. But maybe this one will be different.
[[Frown Party Entrance]]


:: Pre-Bathroom {"position":"1500,700","size":"100,100"}
(Suddenly, a large group of guests enter the ballroom.)
(One of them catches the vampires eye and he clearly recognises them.)

V:"Sorry, I've gotta leave you now for a bit to say hello to an old friend."
"I'll see you around later perhaps?"

/vampire leaves screen
(He leaves before you can respond.)
(Now standing alone in this room, you begin to overthink.)
(The though of walking up to a pre-established group and weaseling your way in makes you sick.)
(The idea of continung to stand here until the vampire is finished talking with his friends makes you sicker.)
(You decide to make your way to the bathroom, to hide out for a bit, maybe courage will come to you if you let yourself relax for a moment.

[[Bathroom]]


